OL,3,GNEWSADeaf teen swimmer up for sports
OL,4,Apersonality award
OL,5,
OL,6,FA "determined" and "inspirational"
OL,7,F16-year-old swimmer who has lived with
OL,8,Fhearing loss since birth has been
OL,9,Fshortlisted for Deaf Sports Personality
OL,10,Fof the Year.
OL,12,FCharlotte Gower from Dunchurch in Rugby
OL,13,Fis up for the award after winning seven
OL,14,Fmedals for Great Britain, including
OL,15,Fthree golds, at the Deaflympics in
OL,16,FTokyo last year.
OL,18,FThe teenager said it was an "honour" to
OL,19,Fbe nominated for the accolade
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,354,350,200,160,0,100
