OL,3,GNEWSADeaf teen swimmer up for sports
OL,4,Apersonality award
OL,5,
OL,6,F"It's really special, especially with
OL,7,Fhow young I am," she said. "There are
OL,8,Fother people who have done amazing
OL,9,Fthings. It shows there's no limit to
OL,10,Fwhat I can achieve."
